### ABOUT THE APACHE SOFTWARE FOUNDATION

The Apache Software Foundation provides organizational, legal,
and financial support for the Apache open-source software projects.
Formed by members of the Apache Group, the group still exists
beyond the participation of individual volunteers, to enable
contributions of intellectual property and financial support,
and to provide a vehicle for limiting legal exposure while participating
in open-source projects. For more information on the Apache Software
Foundation, please see
<URI:[[]http://www.apache.org/](http://www.apache.org/)>.
